Z||000009||fierogt88||05-15-2001||09:10 AM||||I was in the video store checking out DVD's when this rather large and rotund fellow in overalls asked me if that was my "fiaro" outside.  After I acknowledged the fact, he proceeded to tell me how he used to have one but the suspension was to weak to support him.  He then asked me if mine came with the factory 305SB like his did.  "No, mines an 88, they only offered 2, 4, and 6 cylinder engines during the last year."  He then acted like he just remembered that, and said "yeah, mine was an 83, the first year".  Oh well, at least he was talking about it like it was a cool car, even if he was truly clueless.||||reg||5
